RECOGNITION:

Question me words aaye:

✓ Reverse
✓ Reverse Between
✓ Reorder

=> Reverse Pattern

MEMORY TRICK:

Save Next

↓

Reverse Link

↓

Move Prev

↓

Move Curr

TEMPLATE:

ListNode prev = null;

ListNode curr = head;

while(curr != null){

    ListNode next =
            curr.next;

    curr.next = prev;

    prev = curr;

    curr = next;
}

return prev;

TIME  : O(n)
SPACE : O(1)

