=> Floyd Cycle Detection

TRICK:

Cycle hai

=> Fast Slow ko pakad lega

Cycle nahi hai

=> Fast null ho jayega

TEMPLATE:

ListNode slow = head;

ListNode fast = head;

while(
    fast != null &&
    fast.next != null
){

    slow = slow.next;

    fast = fast.next.next;

    if(slow == fast){

        return true;
    }
}

return false;

