7. MERGE TWO SORTED LISTS ⭐⭐⭐
===============================================================================

KAB USE HOTA HAI?

✓ Merge Lists
✓ Merge K Lists
✓ Merge Sort
✓ Sorting Problems

RECOGNITION:

Question me words aaye:

✓ Merge
✓ Sorted Lists

=> Merge Pattern

TEMPLATE:

ListNode dummy =
        new ListNode(-1);

ListNode tail = dummy;

while(
    l1 != null &&
    l2 != null
){

    if(l1.val < l2.val){

        tail.next = l1;

        l1 = l1.next;
    }
    else{

        tail.next = l2;

        l2 = l2.next;
    }

    tail = tail.next;
}

if(l1 != null)
    tail.next = l1;

if(l2 != null)
    tail.next = l2;

return dummy.next;

TIME  : O(n+m)
SPACE : O(1)

