9. REMOVE NTH NODE FROM END
===============================================================================

PATTERN:

Fast Slow Pointer

KAB USE HOTA HAI?

✓ Nth Node From End

TRICK:

Fast ko n+1 step aage bhejo

Distance maintain karo

TEMPLATE:

ListNode dummy =
        new ListNode(0);

dummy.next = head;

ListNode slow = dummy;

ListNode fast = dummy;

for(int i=0;i<=n;i++){

    fast = fast.next;
}

while(fast != null){

    slow = slow.next;

    fast = fast.next;
}

slow.next =
slow.next.next;

return dummy.next;

TIME  : O(n)
SPACE : O(1)

