10. INTERSECTION OF TWO LISTS
===============================================================================

PATTERN:

Two Pointer

KAB USE HOTA HAI?

✓ Intersection Node

RECOGNITION:

Question me:

Two Linked Lists

Common Node

Intersection

TRICK:

Dono equal distance travel karte hain

TEMPLATE:

ListNode a = headA;

ListNode b = headB;

while(a != b){

    a =
    (a == null)
    ? headB
    : a.next;

    b =
    (b == null)
    ? headA
    : b.next;
}

return a;

TIME  : O(n+m)
SPACE : O(1)

